# Vercel Web Analytics Configuration Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics has been successfully verified and confirmed to be properly installed and configured in this Next.js application.

## Current State
The project already has Vercel Web Analytics fully implemented and operational:

### Package Installation ✅
- `@vercel/analytics` package (version 2.0.1) is installed in package.json
- All dependencies are properly listed and installed

### Configuration ✅
- **File Modified**: `frontend/src/app/layout.js`
- **Implementation**: Following Next.js App Router pattern
  - Imported `Analytics` component from `@vercel/analytics/next`
  - Placed `<Analytics />` component within the `<body>` element of the root layout
  - This ensures analytics tracking across all pages in the application

### Framework Details
- **Project Type**: Next.js 16.2.4
- **Router Type**: App Router (modern Next.js routing)
- **Root Layout**: `frontend/src/app/layout.js`

### Code Implementation
```javascript
import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>
        <Navbar />
        <main>{children}</main>
        <Footer />
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

