## Next Steps for User
To complete the setup and start collecting analytics data:

1. **Enable Analytics on Vercel Dashboard**:
   - Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
   - Click on "Analytics" in the sidebar
   - Click the "Enable" button

2. **Deploy to Vercel**:
   - Run `vercel deploy` or push to your connected git repository
   - Vercel will automatically detect and enable the analytics

3. **Verify Data Collection**:
   - After deployment, visit your site
   - Open browser DevTools → Network tab
   - Look for requests to `/_vercel/insights/*` or similar
   - Check your Vercel dashboard's Analytics section to view collected data

## Implementation Notes
- The implementation follows official Vercel documentation exactly
- Uses the recommended approach for Next.js App Router
- Analytics component is placed at the app root level for global tracking
- No additional configuration files needed
- Works seamlessly with existing application structure

