- `frontend/package.json` - Contains @vercel/analytics dependency
- `frontend/src/app/layout.js` - Contains Analytics component integration
- `frontend/package-lock.json` - Locked dependency versions

The analytics setup is complete and requires no further code changes. The application is ready to collect analytics data once deployed to Vercel with analytics enabled in the dashboard.
